## 1. Executive Summary

Build a **production-grade SaaS platform** that lets multiple educational institutes (colleges, universities, coaching centers) register, pay a monthly subscription, and get a **fully isolated, branded learning management system (LMS)**.

### Core Requirements Recap
| Requirement | Solution |
|:---|:---|
| Multiple institutes register on a single app | Single Next.js app with dynamic tenant routing |
| Monthly payment by each institute | Stripe Billing with per-tenant subscription |
| Separate database per institute | Schema-per-Tenant inside a single PostgreSQL RDS |
| Super Admin controls everything | Global admin dashboard at `admin.edusaas.com` |
| Handle 25 institutes independently | Middleware-based tenant resolver + dynamic DB connections |
| Existing codebase compatibility | Refactor `institute1` / `BCE` fork into multi-tenant codebase |

